{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TwoBrains OneShip</strong> is a chaotic co-op space adventure where two players share one single spaceship \u2014 and its entire control system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission: deliver a crucial package from station to station across the galaxy to stop a chain reaction that could destroy the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy? Think again. Hostile ships, deadly asteroid fields, and a rage-inducing control scheme are all waiting to turn your ship into stardust.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together (or try to), survive the madness, and earn credits to upgrade your ship for future runs. Every successful delivery brings you one step closer to saving the galaxy \u2014 or losing your sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chaotic 2-player co-op with shared controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense deliveries between space stations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade system with meta progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based movement that tests both skill and friendship</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles against enemy ships and environmental hazards</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far can you go before the galaxy \u2014 or your friendship \u2014 explodes?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Died","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4117310/4fbb45adf576d1a3f4d16cc58982203d67657a76.jpg"},{"name":"No longer interested?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4117310/4cf5a3b0a723c66c705ff177fc6001b21ad5decc.jpg"},{"name":"Resignation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4117310/91af9cd435d16248bdd0cf94693df34f48f51170.jpg"},{"name":"Weapons test","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im